From 53eceab1b3d1ea5c0faf97058cb19d07ed82e911 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ted Charles <me@tedcharles.net>
Date: Sat, 15 Aug 2026 15:08:26 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Restore world albedo and wire rshook through the cgame QVM

Disabling TMU1 skipped CollapseMultitexture, so the world drew
lightmaps only (gray bricks, colored lamps). Collapse again and
use LEQUAL on the modulate pass. Rebuild rshook against PERS_TEAM
so wallhack/aimbot are not keyed off player class.
